  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: d2a2b876-8d63-42c2-9811-7570a8994181
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • Nov 2024 achieved highest sales at ~$118,448, indicating strong recent performance
        • Dec 2023 hit ~$97K showing seasonal holiday sales patterns
        • Sep 2021 reached ~$82K suggesting early strong performance in dataset timeframe
        • 48-month data span reveals cyclical sales patterns across multiple years

        Recommendations:
        • Analyze Nov 2024 success factors to replicate high performance strategies
        • Prepare for seasonal peaks by increasing inventory before holiday periods
        • Investigate factors behind Sep 2021 peak to apply learnings to current operations
